{"parse": {"title": "Trading", "pageid": 1234, "revid": 42900, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  \" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 53px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/9/9d/Trading_Button.png/revision/latest?cb=20220923033926\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"(Trading Button)\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/9/9d/Trading_Button.png/revision/latest?cb=20220923033926\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"53\" height=\"51\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Trading Button.png\" data-image-key=\"Trading_Button.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">(Trading Button)</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Trading is a feature that got added in Update 6. The requirements to trade is level 40. Currently, you can trade unit skins and units. As of Update 8 you are only able to trade Limited units, along with unit skins and some relics. Here are some Trading info you may use while Trading. small add = 5-50 add normal add = 50-100 big add = 100-200 huge add = 200-500 massive add = 500+ and above\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trade_Tax\">Trade Tax</span></h2>\n<p>Every trade has a tax that is scaled off the rarity.\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"C(Rare) game-font-face\">Rare</span> skins - <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">50 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">50 Gems</span></span></a></li>\n<li><span class=\"C(Epic) game-font-face\">Epic</span> skins - <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">100 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">100 Gems</span></span></a></li>\n<li><span class=\"C(Legendary) Tsh(Game) game-font-face\">Legendary</span> skins - <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">200 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">200 Gems</span></span></a></li>\n<li><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Mythical) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">Mythical<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">Mythical</span></span> skins - <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\