s\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">200 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">200 Gems</span></span></a></li>\n<li><span class=\"C(Legendary) Tsh(Game) game-font-face\">Legendary</span> units (including <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Fist\" title=\"Fire Fist\">Fire Fist</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Renzi\" title=\"Renzi\">Renzi</a> and <span class=\"new\" title=\"Ichi (Full Hollow) (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSWNoaV8oRnVsbF9Ib2xsb3cpP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\"><b>Ichi</b> (<b>Full Hollow</b>)</span>) - <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">400 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">400 Gems</span></span></a></li>\n<li>Pre-evolve <span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Mythical) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">Mythical<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">Mythical</span></span> &amp; <span class=\"C(Secret) game-font-face\">Secret</span> units - <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">4000 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">4000 Gems</span></span></a></li>\n<li>Post-evolve <span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Mythical) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">Mythical<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">Mythical</span></span> &amp; <span class=\"C(Secret) game-font-face\">Secret</span> units - <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">6000 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">6000 Gems</span></span></a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>As of <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log\" title=\"Update Log\">Update 11.7.5</a>, Skins, Limited units that are now unavailable (that are not <a href=\"/wiki/Battlepass\" title=\"Battlepass\">Battlepass</a> units), <a href=\"/wiki/Lulu\" title=\"Lulu\">Lulu</a>, and Limited Relics can be traded.</li>\n<li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li>\n<li>Only limited units can be traded.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261019014008\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 308/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: